OL,3,CNational Eisteddfod to return to
OL,4,CCardiff in 2028
OL,6,FThe National Eisteddfod will be held
OL,7,Fin Cardiff in 2028, it has been
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FCardiff Council has announced that the
OL,11,Ffestival will return to the capital in
OL,12,F2028, marking the festival's first
OL,13,Fvisit to the city in a decade.
OL,15,FThe announcement comes at the end of
OL,16,Fthis year's event which was held in
OL,17,FLlantwd, Pembrokeshire.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/4
