OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786429087
OL,3,CNational Eisteddfod to return to
OL,4,CCardiff in 2028
OL,6,FWelcoming the announcement, the Leader
OL,7,Fof Cardiff Council, Cllr Chris Weaver,
OL,8,Fsaid: "The National Eisteddfod is the
OL,9,Flargest and most important celebration
OL,10,Fof Welsh language and culture in our
OL,11,Fnational calendar and I'm incredibly
OL,12,Fpleased that, for the first time in a
OL,13,Fdecade, it is returning to our capital
OL,14,Fcity in 2028.
OL,16,F"Cardiff has a proud track record of
OL,17,Fstaging major events, and we look
OL,18,Fforward to welcoming visitors from
OL,19,Facross Wales and beyond for what is
OL,20,Fsure to be a memorable and inspiring
OL,21,FEisteddfod."
OL,26,@pD@GOUxD@AOU
